  "behavior": [
    "Daemon-owned conversation session binds the boot, Buddy surface, session, subscription, request and generation before microphone admission",
    "Microphone permission retains its WAL decision and exactly one audio work permit; cancellation waits for the actual capture open and join",
    "Ordered VAD progress qualifies utterances once, configured STT produces text, and each transcript receives a fresh authorized GuiChat request",
    "Provider confirmation exposes safe route and endpoint information while sealed authority stays in the daemon; denied provider turns return to listening",
    "Bounded Unicode text batching, generation-bound synthesis and PCM playback retain ordering and suppress stale results",
    "Existing authenticated audit RPC provides bound availability, preflight, decision, start, abort, control, revoke, replay and attach operations",
    "Owner and relay settlement retain typed failures and fully join cleanup before final status",
    "Per-session retained settlement keeps the exact worker handle and cached error after a caller timeout; only the matching successfully joined reap can release its slot",
    "Feature-off builds omit audio-only implementation roots; unit tests and live-audio retain them, while subtype decoding and closed-header rejection remain always active"
  ],
